  "notes": "ESA's Conferences page is stale: it says ASTRA is 'always held at ESTEC' and lists the 2025 edition as 6-9 Oct 2025, while the Proceedings page gives Leiden, 7-9 Oct 2025. ASTRA 2023 was the 17th Symposium, so 2025 was presumably the 18th. The 2025 venue (Scheltema, Leiden) appears only in a DFKI publication record surfaced by search; the page returned 403, so it is left null. Probable next edition: 2027 by the biennial pattern; not announced, and atpi.eventsair.com/astra2027 returns 404. Do not confuse this series with Embry-Riddle's ASTRA workshop (Oct 2026), IIST's ASTRA symposium (India) or NASA's Ad ASTRA.",
